        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6940 Mortise Denver Entry Set with 5105 Modern Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFeaturing concealed mounting screws, the contemporary Denver Entry Set has an ultra sleek look. This Estate Collection Denver 6940 Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in single cylinder and dummy set functions; plus it is ADA compliant.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/site/product.cfm?id=324406\"><b>Baldwin 5105 Modern Safety Leverset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary 6940 Denver Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and 003 PVD Polished Brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estate Collection Denver Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5105 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .093\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: .937\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1.906\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6940.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Denver Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-2-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"250\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\"></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Denver Mortise Entrance Set, Baldwin 6940",
                "description": "Baldwin 6940 Denver Entryset - Featuring concealed mounting screws, the contemporary Denver Entry Set has an ultra sleek look. This Estate Collection Denver  6940 Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in single cylinder, emergency egress, and dummy set functions; plus it is ADA compliant.",
                "keywords": "baldwin 6940, BAL-6940, bladwin Denver entrance sets, baldwin Denver entrysets, square entry sets, modern entry sets, solid brass entrysets, mortise entrysets, mortise entrance sets, mortise handlesets, single cylinder entrance sets, contemporary front door hardware, baldwin estate collection entry sets, baldwin estates collection entrance sets,"
